* ngspice startup flags. ngspice only reads .spiceinit from its current
* directory, so tools/osic copies this file into build/ on every run.
* (From mini-mosbius-configurator, where these were worked out.)
*
* Do NOT add `set ngbehavior=hsa`: it changes the default element scale
* factor and breaks bin selection for the binned HV FET models
* (sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5, used in pad_model) -> "could not find a
* valid modelname".
set skywaterpdk
set ng_nomodcheck
set num_threads=8
option noinit
* NOT 'option klu': ngspice 46 refuses .noise with KLU ("Noise simulation is
* not (yet) supported with 'option KLU'"). Add it per deck for big transients.
